# PriceWise AI Staging Frontend - Preview deployment API configuration
#
# Vercel loads .env.<environment> from the repository for the matching build
# environment: .env.production for production builds, .env.preview for preview
# builds. The staging frontend points at the staging backend in both cases.
#
# Never point a build at the production backend without an explicit decision:
# these two URLs are the staging services.
VITE_API_URL=https://pricewise-backend-staging.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://pricewise-backend-staging.onrender.com
